{"id":"ec030649243aa657","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-modal-no-negated-box.md","title":"Modal G Proves No Formula of the Form Not-Box X","display":"thm-modal-no-negated-box — Modal G Proves No Formula of the Form Not-Box X","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-modal-no-negated-box","aliases":["92-thm-modal-no-negated-box"],"display":"thm-modal-no-negated-box — Modal G Proves No Formula of the Form Not-Box X","source":"第 XI 章 p. 134，Exercise 15（PDF 151）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable]]","[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-modal-no-negated-box"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-modal-no-negated-box</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modal-no-negated-box — Modal G Proves No Formula of the Form Not-Box X"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 134，Exercise 15（PDF 151）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f1a5dcc2c5a5996\" href=\"?note=1f1a5dcc2c5a5996\" title=\"92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable\">92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e69e849d9714457a\" href=\"?note=e69e849d9714457a\" title=\"92-df-modal-k-k4-g\">92-df-modal-k-k4-g</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 可含命题变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{\\Box}X=X\\supset\\bot\">\\(\\neg_{\\Box}X=X\\supset\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}no\\text{-}negated\\text{-}box}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\nvdash\\neg_{\\Box}\\Box X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}no\\text{-}negated\\text{-}box}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\nvdash\\neg_{\\Box}\\Box X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>底→X 是重言式，Nec 和 A2 给 Box 底→Box X。反置可证，所以若 G 证明 ¬Box X，它证明 ¬Box 底，违背上一节点。本结论的全公式范围靠句法推导，没有扩张 letterless 真值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable","status":"resolved","id":"1f1a5dcc2c5a5996","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-k-k4-g","status":"resolved","id":"e69e849d9714457a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_{\\Box}X=X\\supset\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}no\\text{-}negated\\text{-}box}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\nvdash\\neg_{\\Box}\\Box X.","display":true}],"bytes":1002,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable]]、[[92-thm-modal-no-negated-box]]、[[92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable]]给出一致性不可证与练习15–16。letterless 稳定性不未经证明推广到含命题变量的全部公式域。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-285","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-no-negated-box]]"}],"outgoin